    <comment>- Add bcachefs-tools-pagecache-div_u64.patch: Use div_u64 for
  disk_res.r.sectors division to fix __udivdi3 modpost link error
  in 32-bit kernel module build.
- Add bcachefs-tools-fusemount-32bit-time_t.patch: Widen tv_sec to
  i64 before unsigned_abs() so Duration::from_secs() compiles on
  32-bit targets like i586.</comment>
